en-US.text:
The sun rises in the east, illuminating the world;
The clouds disperse, revealing a clear sky.
Career advancements and requests go smooth;
Prosperity smiles upon all endeavor.

Rolling waves never seem to cease;
Navigating the vast sea requires caution.
Wait until the wind and sea grow calm;
Only then can you sail smoothly and safely.

Dark clouds gather and obscure the sky;
The path is tough with hidden traps ahead.
Impulsive rashness brings misfortune;
Stay humble and cautious to remain safe.
